{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26683","headline":"寄九华费冠卿 · 姚合","name":"寄九华费冠卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥[罾]缴外，高鸟与潜鱼。\n阙下无朝籍，林间有诏书。\n夜眠青玉洞，晓饭白云蔬。\n四海人空老，九华君独居。\n此心谁复识，日与世情疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}